      "message": "Done. Only compile-time-constant arrays will be considered now.\n\nTrivia tidbit: there\u0027s a middle-ground implementation here which I considered:\n\n  https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/469528/3/src/sksl/ir/SkSLIndexExpression.cpp\n\nThis allows the chosen index to have side-effects, but none of the other indices can. The value-add here is very very low. I thought it was worth calling out since it was already written. (I came up with this solution before realizing comma-expressions could do better.)",
